 "strings": {
  "A beautiful yellow liquid. Slightly increases experience points in the Gunman style, I'm told.": "",
  "A brilliant, golden sword. Reduces Heat Gauge consumption when using special moves.": "",
  "(I don't have anything to give.)": "",
  "(I should offer something that gives energy.)": "",
  "(Hm, what do I want to eat?)": "",
  "(I haven't got anything edible.)": "",
  "Exchane 1 ryo for 100 points.": "",
  "Exchange 1000 mon for 10 points.": "",
  "Hot soba topped with vegetable tempura. Also served with an egg,\nwhich we recommend breaking and mixing into the broth.\nA favorite recipe of ours.": "",
  "Thank you, sir. That will be {s_value}.": "",
  "Thank you, sir. That's {s_value}, please.": "",
  "Thank you. Your total is {s_value}, please.": "",
  "Much obliged. Goin' to be {s_value}.": "",
  "Thank you, sir. That'll be {s_value}.": "",
  "Thank you. Your meal comes to {s_value}.": "",
  "Thank ye. It's {s_value} t'day.": "",
  "Thanks. That'll be {s_value}.": "",
  "Thanks for coming. Your total's {s_value}.": "",
  "Thank you. That will be {s_value}.": "",
  "Thank you. Your total is {s_value}.": "",
  "Thank you. That'll be {s_value}.": "",
  "Thanks, that'll be {s_value}. Heheh.": "",
  "This thing's loaded with veggies 'n shit. It's so good for ya, yer body'll black out from the nutrition!": "",
  "I call it a mystery stew, 'cause it's a mystery what's in it. Sure, it's questionable, but it smells damn good, eh?": "",
  "Uh, think this is yesterday's, but it's still good. Hell, it's better day-old, I say. Just get drunk first... fer safety's sake.": "",
  "Comes to {s_value}, please and thank you.": "",
  "Thanks, that'll be {s_value}. Come again.": "",
  "Heh, {s_value}.": "",
  "A special assortment of nine kinds of sashimi. Enjoy the catches of the season.": "",
  "Made by adding grated yam to sake. It's said to be nourishing and good to eat when sick.": "",
  "I gather up whatever drinks I can, then slosh 'em all together in the same jug. Don't like how it tastes? Try it again tomorrow!": "",
  "I'm not too sure what's in it, ta be honest. It'll get ya drunk, though, and it probably won't kill ya.": "",
  "A Hanamaru staple, featuring udon slathered in green onions and\ngrated daikon. Don't think twice about eating—bukkake udon refers to\nsplashing the noodles with just enough sauce to give it some flavor.": "",
  "It's a stew, all... stewed up 'n whatnot. Look, it don't matter what's been stewin' in there, it's tasty and it's cheap!": "",
  "Thank you! That'll be {s_value}.": "",
  "Smooth an' salty eggplant—for those who've got a hunger to go with their thirst.": "",
  "It's {s_value}, if'n it please ya.": "",
  "Thanks! I'll need {s_value} from ya.": "",
  "The true flavor of a first-class restaurant, this dish elegantly pairs sea bream and an out-of-this-world green tea rice.": "",
  "Noodles fresh from the pot, topped with scallions, daikon,\nand our special soy sauce. It's a no-frills experience\nthat true udon lovers keep craving.": "",
  "Fried tofu, liberally seasoned atop a bed of lightly vinegared rice.\nA match made in heaven, made for those craving something unique.": "",
  "It's a hot pot with all my favorite foods, heh. Try it! It's like a party in yer mouth! And in yer gut!": "",
  "A plump, whole sea bream simmered in\nsweet-and-spicy soy sauce.": "",
  "Truly a local favorite, the seaweed broth does wonders for a cold body.": "",
  "My specialty brew! A mix-up of all kindsa sake—there's nothin' else like it! Ha!": "",
  "The most widely drunk tea in Japan, with many health benefits.": "",
  "A popular dish that's been featured since we first opened. \nEnjoy our signature dipping sauce over a nest of chewy\nnoodles and a ready-to-burst softboiled egg.": "",
  "Our standard shippoku offering. A medley of Japanese, Chinese, and Western cuisine for a reasonable price.": "",
  "Our high-end shippoku platter. Enjoy the flavor of the seasons with carefully curated ingredients.": "",
  "Filled with fried tofu bursting with Hanamaru's signature broth.\nThe firm noodles and soft tofu create a harmony on the tongue.": "",
  "We stuff fresh Tosan blue mackerel fulla sushi rice. The fish's oiliness'll fill anyone's belly, guaranteed.": "",
  "Tosan sake, pure an' spicy, just like the folk 'round here.": "",
  "Ah, the famous skipjack tuna of Tosa. We slice it and provide ye a bevy of condiments to enjoy it with.": "",
  "Standard dish or ultimate specialty? You decide,\nas the simple mixture of anchovy broth and handmade\nnoodles ferries your hunger up the Sanzu River.": "",
  "Bluefin is our house specialty, and this combination\nplate lets you tantalize your tastebuds with lean tuna,\nfatty tuna, and everything in between.": "",
  "A specialty soba made with European cooking techniques. The dried sardines\nadds to the broth's complex flavor, resulting in an irresistible bowl.": "",
  "Seasonal vegetables, pickled. A classic accompaniment for sake.": "",
  "Veggies pickled in rice bran oil. Ain't nothin' in the world goes better with sake than this shit.": "",
  "It's a buncha shit cooked up in a pot, whaddya want from me? This look like the Imperial Kitchen to you?": "",
  "This bowl is topped with red ginger tempura, making it surprisingly\nrefreshing for fried food. The perfect way to end a night of drinking.": "",
  "Fresh squid is seared whole, giving it a savory aroma and a unique texture.": "",
  "A selection of fresh sashimi selected by our chefs to showcase the flavors of the season.": "",
  "A shippoku meal served only at lunchtime. Affordable, but still extravagant.": "",
  "Our soft and flavorful teriyaki chicken pairs well with rice. The umami is extraordinary.": "",
  "Manju with a dreamy chestnut paste. This here's a seasonal special—only comes in the autumn!": "",
  "Shochu that uses chestnuts for a base. Their scent an' sweetness keeps this goin' down easy.": "",
  "Hot green tea. Enjoy the harmony of sweet and bitter.": "",
  "Cloudy sake made from fermented rice. Drink carefully—it's been known to sneak up on you.": "",
  "Cloudy sake made from cooked rice. This'll get ya drunk but quick!": "",
  "Freshly boiled noodles, served with warm dipping broth.\nTheir hot, chewy texture is what put Sanuki on the map.": "",
  "They say this booze was invented by monkeys whose fruit hoard spoiled. Those were some smart fuckin' monkeys!": "",
  "A dish of mochi and sweet red beans, it will warm you to your core on cold days.": "",
  "A type of sushi where the rice is wrapped with sweet and spicy deep-fried tofu pockets.": "",
  "Sake made in the capital of Kinai. Newly popular, it's crafted from top-quality rice and water.": "",
  "Sake made in the capital of Kinai, newly popular and crafted from fine quality rice and water.": "",
  "Black cod marinated in white miso, grilled to perfection by our chefs. Enjoy the unmistakable aroma of grilled miso.": "",
  "We fancy this a festival dish 'ere in Tosa. A full plate a' sushi and sashimi to gob down on.": "",
  "This sake passed through the lips of beautiful women, who then spit it out. Don'tcha wanna taste it now?": "",
  "This dish's spiciness maximizes the taste of the meat and the soba--as well as your appetite. A very popular spicy dish.": "",
  "Packed up meat and some other doodads, rolled inta balls. It's got nutrients, so it gives ya strength!": "",
  "Our top-of-the-line shippoku platter. Enjoy the luxurious flavors prepared with the finest ingredients.": "",
  "Fermented skipjack innards sound tasty enough for ye? You'll end up wolfin' it down like a thief in the night, I'll bet.": "",
  "Noodles made by boiling powdered kudzu root, covered in dew. Valued for its smooth texture and medicinal benefits.": "",
  "Noodles made a' powdered kudzu root, boiled in water. This'll cure any ill that befalls ye, I hear.": "",
  "A sake popular in Satsuma, made from their local sweet potatoes. Has a distinct smell and is very strong.": "",
  "Ya ain't scared 'cause they're bugs, are ya!? They're healthy! And they crisp up real nice, so they smell great!": "",
  "Grape wine popular with Westerners. The taste supposedly improves with age.": "",
  "Our katsudon takes inspiration from Western-style\nbreaded cutlets, as does the curry sauce it's served with.": "",
  "Our soba is the embodiment of \"Japanese spirit, Western technique.\"\nSimply top the noodles with fried meat and potatoes, and indulge.": "",
  "Our signature bowl, featuring a fried pork, a bed of rice, egg, and special sauce. Prepared with a Western technique.": "",
  "Ya make it by addin' grated yam to sake. Ma always gave this to us when we were sick as kids, the old drunk.": "",
  "Kamatora": "",
  "A dozen fresh ingredients adorn this luxurious rice bowl.\nAccept no imitations!": "",
  "Three-flavored dango. It's made from rice so it's quite filling.": "",
  "When worn, this pin prevents exhaustion while dancing.": "",
  "The ultimate symbol of strength. By wearing this you make a bold claim, and enemies will flock to you to challenge it.": "",
  "If a fight is won while this binding is worn, something lucky is supposed to happen.": "",
  "This belt grants you the strength to lift heavy enemies as if they weighed nothing at all.": "",
  "This unusual ring will make your attacks stronger as your health is depleted.": "",
  "Legend tells of a dragon who tore off his scale and gave it to a mortal in thanks for removing the dragon's curse. The scale is very sharp!": "",
  "A sinister sword that is always dripping with blood. Ability: Yo. Drains the health of enemies while attacking.": "",
  "These earrings are full of energy and pathos which will feed your spirit, making you less likely to fall while dancing.": "",
  "This kit features a group of highly influential troopers that have traveled through space, time, and reality to serve the Shinsengumi.": "",
  "Through clever trickery, this tail was taken from a wicked dragon. Folks say it can tear through stone as if it were paper.": "",
  "This metal roof ornament depicts a shachihoko, a legendary creature with the head of a tiger and body of a carp. It can do serious damage.": "",
  "This unusual pistol never runs out of bullets.": "",
  "This dragon seal once belonged to a Chinese emperor. Its aura is brimming with great power.": "",
