  "Fight the rogues that infest the city at night, and when you're done with them, the powerful foe Okada Izo as well.": "夜の街にはびこる悪党や、その先にいる\n強敵「岡田以蔵」との戦闘を楽しむことができます。",
  "Be a part of a Shinsengumi officers meeting; enjoy walking around the town of Kyo and engage in battles. ": "新選組の幹部会をはじめ、「京」の街や戦闘を\n楽しむことができます。",
